  "title": "Vanilla Remastered in the browser (levels 1-20)",
  "comment": "The 1.12 browser slice (owner 2026-10-31: 'minimal slices for 1-20 leveling'). vr-slice.py reads this. Tiers are taken in order until budgetMB (or until the disk would keep less than minFreeMB); the first tier that does not fit and every tier after it are left out, and the report says so. A zone is a WorldMapArea.dbc AreaName (its world-map rectangle gives the map tiles, widened by marginTiles); an instance is a whole Map.dbc map id. Creatures and objects come from the realm's own spawns inside the tiers' tiles (their model folders and sounds). Only names the player's own client would read are ever written: paths inside the game's archives, nothing else.",
